# Keep line endings identical on macOS and Windows.
#
# Everything git detects as text is stored as LF in the repository and checked
# out as LF in both working trees, so a file edited on Windows and a file edited
# on the Mac produce the same bytes. Without this the repo drifts into a mix of
# CRLF and LF and every cross-machine pull shows whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never inspected or converted.
*.png binary
*.docx binary
